      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the relief isnt from \"navigating\" it? what if the relief is just... not having to be this person anymore? i feel like i'm mourning someone who hasn't even died yet. there's no way to go back to how things were. the world has already decided who i am, and they've decided i'm nothing. it feels like there's no point in trying to fix a life that's already been destroyed.",
